<title>UK: Jordan to launch debut Eurobond within 4-5 months.</title>
<headline>Jordan to launch debut Eurobond within 4-5 months.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan will launch its debut Eurobond, a $70 million issue, within 4-5 months, deputy central bank governor Michele Marto said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to have a benchmark Eurobond issue within four to five months maximum. This will be the first sovereign issue for Jordan,&quot; he told bankers at a conference here.  </p>
<p>Marto also said Jordan intended to develop short term liquidity instruments in the form of Treasury bills.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
